WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
[Instrumental music. A field of glass and golden connections.]

00:05.000 --> 00:11.000
[A light-filled library. Keep what we learn. Keep the evidence.]

00:11.000 --> 00:18.000
[A single touch reaches a golden record.]

00:18.000 --> 00:26.900
[Light travels through the connected structure.]

00:26.900 --> 00:31.000
[Cantos. The connected field continues to move.]
